{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "bd395166-522a-8bcf-b387-331497438f84",
  "created_at": "2025-12-16T11:17:36-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "David Kim",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:11:56-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:12:00-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Denise. Yeah, I'm calling about a lake. Not a big one, but it's got its own zip code at this point."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:12:14-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, where's the lake?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:12:17-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's a catch basin on the corner by the middle school, and it's been packed with leaves since Monday. Last Monday, I mean, a week ago. The puddle just sits there. It never drains."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:12:38-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So it's not from a storm, it's just sitting there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:12:45-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, no storm. It's been dry. Cold but dry. That's what makes it annoying. Nothing's coming down and the water's still there because the grate's buried."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:13:01-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "How deep are we talking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:13:05-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "About up to the hubcaps. I watched a guy in a little sedan slow down to a crawl and kind of wince going through it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:13:21-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that'll do it. Which corner exactly? Do you have the two streets?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:13:30-05:00",
      "duration": 34,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's the corner right outside the school, the side with the main entrance. Hang on, I'm walking up to it so I can read the sign. [pause] Okay, it's the corner by the front lot, where the crossing guard stands. I can't see a street sign from here, the line's not great, I'm on my cell."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:14:04-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's okay. Front entrance of the middle school, where the crossing guard stands. Is the basin on the school side or across the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:14:19-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "School side. Right at the curb, on the downhill corner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:14:26-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And is it just leaves blocking it, or do you see trash, branches, anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:14:38-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just leaves. Wet, matted down, a thick mat of them. Looks like somebody laid a brown carpet over the grate."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:14:51-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. That's usually a quick one for the crew, they just clear it by hand or with the vac truck. I'll put in a work order now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:15:08-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Do the crews work weekends? Because if this waits till Saturday I'll probably go out there with a rake myself."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:15:21-05:00",
      "duration": 26,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please don't go out in the road with a rake. Some weekend coverage exists, but a clogged drain with no storm is a weekday job. I'm marking it standing water, so it should get looked at in the next day or two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:15:47-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Next day or two. I'll hold you to that, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:15:54-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough. Do you want a call back when it's done?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:16:01-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, that'd be fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:16:04-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "What's the best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:16:07-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0185."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:16:09-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero one eight five. And the name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:16:14-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "David Kim. K-I-M."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:16:17-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, David. Anything else you can see from there that I should note? Ice, a sinkhole, anything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:16:28-05:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No sinkhole. The water's pooled across half the lane though, so cars are swinging out around it. And I'll say, the gym door's propped open, and it smells like floor wax out here. Strong. I guess they're refinishing the floors."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:16:53-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That'd be the winter break prep. Okay, I'll note half the lane is covered, that helps the crew prioritize."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:17:05-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Appreciate it. I figured this was a ten-minute fix for somebody with a shovel."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:17:14-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Pretty much. They'll probably be in and out. You'll get a call from us once it's closed out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:17:26-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:17:28-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got it. Stay warm out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T11:17:33-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Bye."
    }
  ],
